    "PhotonBlocks[modulation, omega, m][finalPoint, initialPoint] computes \
photon-space modulation and additive blocks with photon indices from -m \
through m. PhotonBlocks[{amplitude, vectorPotential, omega}, m][finalPoint, \
initialPoint] constructs the scalar Peierls modulation from a time-dependent \
vector potential and its amplitude. PhotonBlocks[{vectorPotential, omega}, \
m][finalPoint, initialPoint] uses unit vector-potential amplitude.", 
